      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The skeletal crocodile detaches its skull and fires it at a target within 30 feet, making a bite Strike. If the Strike is successful and the target is Large or smaller, the crocodile uses a heavy chain to retract its skull back to its body, dragging the targeted creature 30 feet."
